      "supplementalOverview": [
        [
          {
            "text": "Each untreated unit provides 12 sprays. Depending on the selected mode and eligible recipe, sprayed inputs provide +12.5% extra products or +25% production speed, with +30% production power consumption. These bonuses are reference information; the Factory Planner does not apply proliferation."
